#. ほうほう、なるほど。
#. それはつまり…って全然わかんねーぞ！
msgctxt "0001 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Hmm, yes, I see. So what you're saying is...I have\n"
"absolutely no idea!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もう一度、よく考えてみるんだ。
#. どこかにこの議論の矛盾が隠されているはず…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I need to think about it one more time. There must be\n"
"a contradiction in there somewhere...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. な、何よ…
#. 私のどこが間違っているっていうのよ…
msgctxt "0003 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Wh-What? You think s-something I said is wrong?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もう一度、よく考えてみるんだ。
#. どこかにこの議論の矛盾が隠されているはず…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I need to think about it one more time. There must be\n"
"a contradiction in there somewhere...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>最初に模擬刀の一撃があり、
#. そして、次に包丁が取り出された…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The sword was used first, and then the knife came\n"
"afterward...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>本当に、その流れでいいのか？
#. 説明の付かない事があるようにも思えるけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Is that really the order of events? That leads to some\n"
"unexplainable details.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>最初に模擬刀で襲い掛かったなら…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>If the person with the sword really did attack\n"
"first...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>模擬刀のあの部分に傷が付いているのは、
#. おかしいよな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...there's no explanation for how a certain part of\n"
"the sword got damaged.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
